    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "Clintlack lies at the far end of the eastern road, three and four stages of cart beyond the port, on the shore of a basin of enclosed water the sea does not reach. That distance decides what leaves: garden ground on the river islands feeds the two villages rather than the port, and only the squarest slab and the best-picked ore are worth putting on a cart at all."
  },
